  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Image Card",
    "Usage",
    "Migrated from Chatter Config 2026-09-01.",
    "Anatomy",
    "200×190 card on surface/base with radius/container and shadow/raised. Image area (surface/background + image fill) hosting a Checkbox when selectable; text area with label/md title, body/sm metadata and a more-menu glyph in icon/secondary.",
    "Variants & props",
    "filled (2)    true · false — false is the dashed create-new tile\nselected (2)  checkbox checked on the image\nhover (2)     checkbox visible unchecked on the image",
    "Usage",
    "Show the checkbox only on hover or when selected.\nKeep titles to one line; metadata to one short line.\nUse the create-new tile as the last item of a grid.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Use it as described under Usage; bind every colour, spacing and radius to a SOLAR token.",
    "DON'T   detach the instance or override its tokens locally — request a change through governance instead."
  ],
